This package implements published psychometric methods, each cited in the documentation of its function and the guide of its
module, among them the DIF categories of ETS and the statistics of automated scores that RSMTool computes. It includes no
code or data of others: its tests compare its results with R and Python packages through fixtures, which it does not ship.

